{"4279510":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"No Mortal Space","steam_appid":4279510,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[4952390],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a true &quot;Power Fantasy&quot; progression. Start as a humble survivor gathering wood and stone, and evolve into a OverDeity who views civilizations as ants. With our fully destructible voxel world, your growth isn't just a stat—it’s the ability to physically reshape planets and shatter mountain ranges with a single talisman.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Interstellar Traversal<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cosmos is your playground. Explore a multi-star system universe where every planet features unique biomes and civilizations. Your mobility scales with your Divine Rank:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early Game: Trekking and short-range flight.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mid Game: Infinite flight and atmospheric escape.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >End Game: Traversing black holes, and piloting massive Interstellar War-Barques to ferry loot across the galaxy.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supreme Resource Gathering<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget tedious grinding. Once you reach Lesser Deity, your efficiency skyrockets.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Artifact to instantly clear-cut forests.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy Earth-Shaking Talismans to detonate and collect entire mines in seconds.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Store it all in your Spatial Sack—the cosmos provides infinite resources for those strong enough to take them and you need huge amount of resource in the road to OverDeity.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4279510\/extras\/d360a51fc71f4e7391182bdc7a4af46a.poster.avif?t=1792386780\" width=1128 height=480 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4279510\/extras\/d360a51fc71f4e7391182bdc7a4af46a.webm?t=1792386780\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4279510\/extras\/d360a51fc71f4e7391182bdc7a4af46a.mp4?t=1792386780\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >High-Octane Outpost Battle<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claim &quot;Prime Resource&quot; outpost through intense, large-scale combat. Slay waves of enemies to absorb Spiritual Qi, overcharging your artifacts to reach exponential power levels. Experience the explosive, high-speed combat as you defend your territory and expand your Sect's reach.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4279510\/extras\/4a6ca0d7a2529d286ea0423fb99e347c.poster.avif?t=1792386780\" width=1128 height=480 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4279510\/extras\/4a6ca0d7a2529d286ea0423fb99e347c.webm?t=1792386780\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4279510\/extras\/4a6ca0d7a2529d286ea0423fb99e347c.mp4?t=1792386780\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Co-op Sect Building<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The path to immortality is better with allies. Join friends to:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-pilot massive Sky War-Barques.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine unique Builds (BD) for Synergy Effects that decimate screen-clearing bosses.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash massive Synergy Formation to wipe out entire armies in an instant.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4279510\/extras\/0af15b45cb8b7693c946dc3da11bf557.poster.avif?t=1792386780\" width=1128 height=480 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4279510\/extras\/0af15b45cb8b7693c946dc3da11bf557.webm?t=1792386780\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4279510\/extras\/0af15b45cb8b7693c946dc3da11bf557.mp4?t=1792386780\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Deity Style Automated Factory<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a sprawling magical industrial empire. Establish Automated Production Lines to refine elixir and forge artifacts.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Divine Automation: Capture and subdue wandering Gods and Demons to serve as your Sect Disciples.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Management: Assign these powerful entities to manage your production units, turning your sect into a self-sustaining powerhouse while you focus on reaching the next Divine Rank.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4279510\/extras\/b1d098302df6ac0f89622c1b1c58637b.poster.avif?t=1792386780\" width=1128 height=480 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4279510\/extras\/b1d098302df6ac0f89622c1b1c58637b.webm?t=1792386780\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4279510\/extras\/b1d098302df6ac0f89622c1b1c58637b.mp4?t=1792386780\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a true &quot;Power Fantasy&quot; progression. Start as a humble survivor gathering wood and stone, and evolve into a OverDeity who views civilizations as ants. With our fully destructible voxel world, your growth isn't just a stat—it’s the ability to physically reshape planets and shatter mountain ranges with a single talisman.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Interstellar Traversal<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cosmos is your playground. Explore a multi-star system universe where every planet features unique biomes and civilizations. Your mobility scales with your Divine Rank:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early Game: Trekking and short-range flight.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mid Game: Infinite flight and atmospheric escape.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >End Game: Traversing black holes, and piloting massive Interstellar War-Barques to ferry loot across the galaxy.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supreme Resource Gathering<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget tedious grinding. Once you reach Lesser Deity, your efficiency skyrockets.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Artifact to instantly clear-cut forests.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy Earth-Shaking Talismans to detonate and collect entire mines in seconds.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Store it all in your Spatial Sack—the cosmos provides infinite resources for those strong enough to take them and you need huge amount of resource in the road to OverDeity.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4279510\/extras\/d360a51fc71f4e7391182bdc7a4af46a.poster.avif?t=1792386780\" width=1128 height=480 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4279510\/extras\/d360a51fc71f4e7391182bdc7a4af46a.webm?t=1792386780\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4279510\/extras\/d360a51fc71f4e7391182bdc7a4af46a.mp4?t=1792386780\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >High-Octane Outpost Battle<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claim &quot;Prime Resource&quot; outpost through intense, large-scale combat. Slay waves of enemies to absorb Spiritual Qi, overcharging your artifacts to reach exponential power levels. Experience the explosive, high-speed combat as you defend your territory and expand your Sect's reach.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4279510\/extras\/4a6ca0d7a2529d286ea0423fb99e347c.poster.avif?t=1792386780\" width=1128 height=480 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4279510\/extras\/4a6ca0d7a2529d286ea0423fb99e347c.webm?t=1792386780\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4279510\/extras\/4a6ca0d7a2529d286ea0423fb99e347c.mp4?t=1792386780\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Co-op Sect Building<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The path to immortality is better with allies. Join friends to:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-pilot massive Sky War-Barques.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine unique Builds (BD) for Synergy Effects that decimate screen-clearing bosses.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash massive Synergy Formation to wipe out entire armies in an instant.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4279510\/extras\/0af15b45cb8b7693c946dc3da11bf557.poster.avif?t=1792386780\" width=1128 height=480 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4279510\/extras\/0af15b45cb8b7693c946dc3da11bf557.webm?t=1792386780\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4279510\/extras\/0af15b45cb8b7693c946dc3da11bf557.mp4?t=1792386780\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Deity Style Automated Factory<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a sprawling magical industrial empire. Establish Automated Production Lines to refine elixir and forge artifacts.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Divine Automation: Capture and subdue wandering Gods and Demons to serve as your Sect Disciples.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Management: Assign these powerful entities to manage your production units, turning your sect into a self-sustaining powerhouse while you focus on reaching the next Divine Rank.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4279510\/extras\/b1d098302df6ac0f89622c1b1c58637b.poster.avif?t=1792386780\" width=1128 height=480 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4279510\/extras\/b1d098302df6ac0f89622c1b1c58637b.webm?t=1792386780\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4279510\/extras\/b1d098302df6ac0f89622c1b1c58637b.mp4?t=1792386780\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","short_description":"Rise from a mortal to a cosmic deity in this voxel-based, open-world survival craft game. Master the power of OverDeity to level forests and shatter mountains, traverse black holes with your physical body. The universe is your resource—conquer it.","supported_languages":"English, Simplified Chinese<strong>*<\/strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*<\/strong>, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Japanese, Portuguese - Portugal, Vietnamese, Korean, French, Italian, German<br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4279510\/f2d9e7fcac26cf89c4fc377a1f6c116bf61abf30\/header.jpg?t=1792386780","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4279510\/318265e8cde75d3b1ab478070e68bef88a3c4ad6\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1792386780","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4279510\/318265e8cde75d3b1ab478070e68bef88a3c4ad6\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1792386780","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10+ 64 Bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel i3-9300<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 80 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10+ 64 Bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel i7-8700<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA RTX 2070<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 12<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 80 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"}}}}